OL,3,AUS billionaire Leon Black defies
OL,4,Asummons and sues Epstein panel
OL,5,
OL,6,FBillionaire investor Leon Black has
OL,7,Ffailed to appear before a US
OL,8,Fcongressional committee investigating
OL,9,Fthe late sex offender Jeffrey Epstein -
OL,10,Finstead filing a lawsuit challenging
OL,11,Fthe committee's efforts to summon him.
OL,13,FThe lawsuit calls the subpoenas issued
OL,14,Fby the House Oversight Committee
OL,15,F"invalid" and says they hold "no
OL,16,Flegitimate connection" to the
OL,17,Fcommittee's legislative aim.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
